OL,3,GNEWSASubsidy warning over fear of
OL,4,A'empty buses'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaxpayers in North Yorkshire could be
OL,7,Fleft to subside "empty buses" if plans
OL,8,Fto franchise services go ahead,
OL,9,Fcouncillors have warned.
OL,11,FNorth Yorkshire Council leader Carl Les
OL,12,Fsaid he did not believe franchising was
OL,13,Fa "silver bullet" for the county's
OL,14,Ftransport issues and worried about the
OL,15,Ffinancial impact.
OL,17,FHe spoke at a meeting where Mayor David
OL,18,FSkaith and members of the York and
OL,19,FNorth Yorkshire Combined Authority
OL,20,Fapproved a #3.5m investment to examine
OL,21,Fthe potential benefit of taking buses
OL,22,Funder public control.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
